OL,3,GNEWSADolly Parton book scheme to launch
OL,4,Ain market town
OL,5,
OL,6,FA children's literacy scheme founded by
OL,7,Fcountry music icon Dolly Parton is set
OL,8,Fto launch in Selby, providing free
OL,9,Fbooks to youngsters until they start
OL,10,Fschool.
OL,12,FDolly Parton's Imagination Library is
OL,13,Fbeing introduced as part of a wider
OL,14,F#400,000 initiative aimed at improving
OL,15,Foutcomes for children and young people
OL,16,Facross North Yorkshire.
OL,18,FFamilies who sign up will receive a
OL,19,Ffree book through the post each month
OL,20,Ffrom birth until their child's fifth
OL,21,Fbirthday.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
