OL,3,GNEWSADolly Parton book scheme to launch
OL,4,Ain market town
OL,5,
OL,6,FParton, who died on 25 August at the
OL,7,Fage of 80, launched the scheme as a
OL,8,Ftribute to her father, who was unable
OL,9,Fto read.
